@startuml HireQuest_Communication_Diagram_Interview
' UML Communication (collaboration) style: objects + numbered messages on links.
' Matches HireQuest: Next.js App Router, NextAuth, Mongoose, Gemini/templates.
' Voice + NLP scoring are not in the repo yet — see optional FUTURE object.
' https://plantuml.com/object-diagram

title HireQuest — communication diagram: authenticated interview flow (as implemented)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam object {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF7ED
  BorderColor #EA580C
}

left to right direction

object "«presentation»\nWeb Client\n(React / Next.js)" as UI #E0E7FF

object "«authentication»\nNextAuth\n(credentials + JWT session)" as AUTH #DCFCE7

object "«control»\nInterview API\n`/api/interviews` …" as API #FEF9C3

object "«domain service»\nQuestion Generator\n`generateInterviewQuestions()`" as QGEN #FFEDD5

object "«persistence»\nMongoDB\n(Mongoose models)" as DB #E2E8F0

object "«future / optional»\nVoice + NLP pipeline\n(not in repo today)" as FUTURE #F1F5F9

' --- Sign-in (dashboard / app shell) ---
UI -down-> AUTH : 1: authenticate / signIn()
AUTH -down-> DB : 2: load user, verify passwordHash
AUTH -up-> UI : 3: session cookie / JWT claims

' --- Create + generate + run interview ---
UI -right-> API : 4: POST /api/interviews (create shell session)
API -down-> DB : 5: insert InterviewSession (status created)

UI -right-> API : 6: POST .../generate-questions
API -right-> QGEN : 7: generateInterviewQuestions(config)
QGEN -left-> API : 8: questions[], source, warnings
API -down-> DB : 9: $set questions, questionSource

UI -right-> API : 10: GET /api/interviews/{id} (load state)
API -down-> DB : 11: findOne by id + userId
API -left-> UI : 12: session JSON

UI -right-> API : 13: PATCH answers / flags / in_progress
API -down-> DB : 14: $set / $push embedded answers

UI -right-> API : 15: PATCH status completed
API -down-> DB : 16: $set completed + timestamps

UI -right-> API : 17: GET /api/interviews/{id} (results)
API -down-> DB : 18: findOne read-only
API -left-> UI : 19: InterviewResultsPage (Q&A review)

' --- Future extension (aligns with teaching sketch) ---
UI ..> FUTURE : (future) 20: voice to transcribe to NLP score
FUTURE ..> DB : (future) persist EvaluationReport

note right of API
  Each handler uses getServerSession; unauthorized
  requests fail before DB (messages 4–19 assume a signed-in user).
end note

note bottom of QGEN
  Code: src/lib/interview-questions/generate.ts
  and src/lib/gemini/generate-questions.ts
end note

@enduml
